From: Blue Cave Bringup <bringup@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] serial: lantiq: allow building on MIPS_GENERIC

Allow selecting SERIAL_LANTIQ on MIPS_GENERIC kernels so GRX350/GRX500
boards booted via arch/mips/generic can use the mainline Lantiq ASC UART
and earlycon driver.

--- a/drivers/tty/serial/Kconfig
+++ b/drivers/tty/serial/Kconfig
@@ -1002,7 +1002,7 @@ config SERIAL_SIFIVE_CONSOLE
 
 config SERIAL_LANTIQ
 	tristate "Lantiq serial driver"
-	depends on (LANTIQ || X86) || COMPILE_TEST
+	depends on (LANTIQ || MIPS_GENERIC || X86) || COMPILE_TEST
 	select SERIAL_CORE
 	help
 	  Support for UART on Lantiq and Intel SoCs.
